msgstr "Nta bihindagurika byabonetse"

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Variable Configuration [ edit: %s ]"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry'impindagurika [ hindura: %s ]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Variable Configuration [new]"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry'impindagurika [nshya]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Internal name"
msgstr "Izina ry'imbere"

#: templates.php
msgid "A unique identifier which will be created by ReportIt itself. Use this ID within the definition of your calculation formulas to include that value the report user has defined individually for it."
msgstr "Ikirango kihariye kizaremwa na ReportIt ubwayo. Koresha iki kirango (ID) mu isobanura ry'imibare yo kubara kugira ngo ushyiremo ako gaciro umukoresha wa raporo yishyiriyeho ku giti cye."

#: templates.php
msgid "A name like \"Threshold\" for example which should be used as a headline within the report config."
msgstr "Izina nka \"Urwego ntarengwa\" urugero rigomba gukoreshwa nk'umutwe w'amagambo mu igenamiterere rya raporo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Provide a name for this Variable"
msgstr "Tanga izina ry'iki gihinduka"

#: templates.php
msgid "A description that explains the sense of this variable."
msgstr "Ibisobanuro bisobanura icyo iyi variyabule isobanura."

#: templates.php
msgid "Provide a meaningful description"
msgstr "Tanga ibisobanuro bifite ireme"

#: templates.php
msgid "Maximum Value"
msgstr "Agaciro ntarengwa"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the upper limit of this variable."
msgstr "Bigena urugero rwo hejuru rw'iki gihinduka."

#: templates.php
msgid "Minimum Value"
msgstr "Agaciro gato gashoboka"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the lower limit of this variable."
msgstr "Bigena urugero rwo hasi rw'iki gihinduka."

#: templates.php
msgid "Default Value"
msgstr "Agaciro mburabuzi"

#: templates.php
msgid "Sets the default value."
msgstr "Bishyiraho agaciro gasanzwe."

#: templates.php view.php
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Ubwoko"

#: templates.php
msgid "The method the report owner should use to define this variable."
msgstr "Uburyo nyir'iyi raporo agomba gukoresha mu gusobanura iki gihindagurika."

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the distance between two values if method \"DropDown\" has been chosen. Please ensure that this value is not set too low, because it defines indirectly the number of options the dropdown field will have. For example the following parameters: MAX:100, MIN:0, STEP:0.01  will result in a select box of 10.001 options. This can cause dramatical performance issues due to a high CPU load at the clients side. Try to keep it under 1000."
msgstr "Bigena intera iri hagati y'agaciro kabiri iyo uburyo bwa \"DropDown\" bwahiswemo. Nyamuneka menya neza ko aka gaciro kadashyizwe hasi cyane, kuko kagira uruhare mu kugena umubare w'amahitamwo umurima wo guhitamo uzagira. Urugero, ibipimo bikurikira: MAX:100, MIN:0, STEP:0.01  bizatanga agasanduku ko guhitamo karimo amahitamwo 10.001. Ibi bishobora gutera ibibazo bikomeye by'imikorere bitewe n'umutwaro mwinshi wa CPU ku ruhande rw'abakoresha. Gerageza kugira ngo bibe munsi ya 1000."

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Metric Configuration [ edit: %s - %s ]"
msgstr "Iboneza ry'igipimo [ hindura: %s - %s ]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Metric Configuration [new]"
msgstr "Iboneza ry'igipimo [gishya]"

#: templates.php
msgid "The explanation given to this measurand. This will be shown as legend within exports as well as a tooltip within the presentation of a report itself."
msgstr "Ibisobanuro bihabwa iki gipimwa. Ibi bizagaragara nk'urufunguzo rw'ibisobanuro mu byoherezwa hanze ndetse n'akadirishya k'ibisobanuro mu imurikwa rya raporo ubwayo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Define a unique abbreviation for this measurand with max. 8 letters/numbers."
msgstr "Shyiraho impine yihariye y'iki gipimo itarengeje inyuguti/imibare 8."

#: templates.php
msgid "The unit given to this measurand. e.g. 'Bits/s'"
msgstr "Urugero rwahawe iki gipimwa. urugero: 'Bits/s'"

#: templates.php
msgid "Consolidation function"
msgstr "Umumaro wo guhuriza hamwe"

#: templates.php
msgid "The name of the consolidation function to define which CDPs should be read out."
msgstr "Izina ry'umumaro wo guhuriza hamwe rigena CDPs zigomba gusomwa."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand should be become part of the final report output. Leave it unflagged if this measurands will only be used as an auxiliary calculation."
msgstr "Hitamo 'fungura' niba iki gipimwa kigomba kuba igice cy'ibisohoka mu nyandiko ya nyuma ya raporo. Kireke nta kimenyetso niba iki gipimwa kizakoreshwa gusa nk'imibare y'inyunganizi."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand will only have one result in total instead of one for every Data Source Item. It's result<br>will be shown separately. Use this option in combination with \"Visible\" = \"off\" if you are looking for a measurand keeping an interim result only that should be reused within the calculation of other measurands without being visible for end users."
msgstr "Hitamo 'fungura' niba iki gipimwa kizagira igisubizo kimwe gusa muri rusange aho kugira kimwe kuri buri Gice cy'Inkomoko y'Amakuru. Igisubizo cyacyo<br>kizagaragara ukwacyo. Koresha aya mahitamo hamwe na \"Visible\" = \"off\" niba ushaka igipimwa kibika igisubizo cy'agateganyo gusa kigomba kongera gukoreshwa mu mibare y'ibindi bipimwa bitagaragariye abakoresha ba nyuma."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formatting"
msgstr "Imitunganyirize"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines as what type the data should be treated as."
msgstr "Bigena ubwoko amakuru agomba gukoreshwamo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "Ubuziranenge"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines how many decimal digits should be displayed for floating-point numbers."
msgstr "Bigena umubare w'imibare y'ibice by'ikumi igomba kugaragazwa ku mibare ifite ibice by'ikumi."

#: templates.php
msgid "Prefixes"
msgstr "Imbanziriza"

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose the type of prefix being used to format the result. With the use of decimal prefixes '1024' will be formatted to '1.024k' while the binary prefixes option returns '1ki'. Select 'off' to display the raw data, here '1024'."
msgstr "Hitamo ubwoko bw'imbanziriza ikoreshwa mu gutunganya igisubizo. Ukoresheje imbanziriza zishingiye ku icumi '1024' izahindurwamo '1.024k' mu gihe uburyo bw'imbanziriza za bineri bugarura '1ki'. Hitamo 'off' kugira ngo werekane amakuru adahinduwe, hano '1024'."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "Inzira y'ibara"

#: templates.php
msgid "The mathematical definition of this measurand. Allowed are all combinations of operators and operands listed below following the rules of mathematics. Use round and square brackets to signify complex terms and the order of operations."
msgstr "Ibisobanuro by'imibare by'iki gipimwa. Ibyemewe ni ibihuje byose by'ibimenyetso by'imibare n'imibare ikoreshwa iri hasi hakurikijwe amategeko y'imibare. Koresha udukubo tuzengurutse n'udukubo dufite inguni kugira ngo ugaragaze imibare igoye n'urutonde rw'ibikorwa."

#: templates.php
msgid "Operators & Operands"
msgstr "Ibimenyetso by'imikorere n'ibikorerwaho"

#: templates.php
msgid "Click on one of the listed operators or operand to append them to your calucalion formula. The tooltip will show you additional information like description, return value, arguments and usage."
msgstr "Kanda kuri kimwe mu bimenyetso cyangwa imibare bigaragara ku rutonde kugira ngo ubyongere mu nteruro yawe yo kubara. Agasanduku k'ubufasha kazakwereka amakuru y'inyongera nk'ibisobanuro, agaciro kagaruka, ibisabwa n'imikoreshereze."

